MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Section 0 — critical persisting issues:
- White-screen flicker root cause: Stack navigator's contentStyle had no
  explicit background, so the default white scene container showed
  through during transitions. Fixed with contentStyle: { backgroundColor }
  driven by the active theme.
- Bottom nav had zero tap feedback. Added AnimatedTabIcon (scale-bounce
  + sliding active-pill background via reanimated) wired into all 5 tabs.
- BrandedLoader (the branded full-screen logo loader) was defined but
  never actually used anywhere in the app — confirmed via search. Wired
  it into Service Detail and the Bidding Dashboard as a brief loading
  state on screen entry, alongside the existing skeleton loaders for
  content lists (the two patterns now coexist as specified).
- Verified: hardcoded 'Alex Johnson' greeting — none found anywhere in
  the codebase (already fixed in a prior pass). Logo size/left-alignment
  on Home — already correct (42px, left-aligned in a space-between row).

Section 2 — Services: found and fixed a real functional gap
- The filter bottom sheet's Apply button did nothing but close the sheet
  () — selected filters were never
  communicated back to the Services list.
- Added FilterContext (shared state) so Apply now actually pushes
  category/price-range/rating selections back to the Services tab,
  which applies them live in its existing filter logic. Filter sheet
  also now opens pre-populated with the currently active filters, and
  the filter button shows an active-filter-count badge for visible
  confirmation it registered.
- Confirmed already correct, no changes needed: Services tab is a
  single continuous screen (search+filter+categories+list), service
  cards show '€price · pts' together, empty state has both 'Get a
  Custom Quote' and 'Start Live Chat'.

Full workspace typecheck: zero errors across all 9 projects.
